flowchart TD
Manager["**Production Manager**<br/>Objectives minimize wip maximize throughput<br/>Input variables buffer capacities {1-10}"]
MOOController["**MOO Controller**<br/>run_nsga2_optimization<br/>pop_size n_gen n_replications base_seed"]
ProblemClass["**BufferCapacityProblem**<br/>n_var 6 n_obj 2 n_replications base_seed n_cores<br/>xl xu elementwise_evaluation"]
NSGA2Algo["**NSGA2 Algorithm**<br/>sampling crossover mutation<br/>pop evolve eliminate_duplicates"]
MultiprocessPool["**Multiprocessing Pool**<br/>processes n_cores<br/>parallel evaluation of individuals"]
Evaluator["**Evaluator**<br/>evaluate_single_individual<br/>aggregates replications returns tuple wip negative_throughput"]
SimWithCaps["**Simulation Runner With Caps**<br/>run_simulation_with_caps<br/>accepts caps list uses DelayBuffer and Machine"]
SimCore["**Simulation Core**<br/>run_simulation<br/>creates env part generator sampling wip throughput"]
DelayBufferClass["**DelayBuffer**<br/>cap delay store tokens in_transit<br/>methods put get free_capacity in_transit_count"]
MachineClass["**Machine**<br/>name input_buffer output_buffer process_time availability mttr capacity<br/>attributes working_time failed_time blocked_time processed_count active_count is_up<br/>methods run _breakdown_cycle waiting_energy_consumption working_energy_consumption"]
InputVars["**Buffer Capacities**<br/>cap_post_loading cap_post_conveyor cap_post_washing cap_pre_press1 cap_pre_press2 cap_post_press12<br/>discrete domain {1-10}"]
HistoryExporter["**History Exporter**<br/>export_history_to_csv<br/>writes generation individual caps wip throughput to csv"]
ResultNode["**Optimization Result**<br/>Pareto front history saved in result object"]

Manager --> MOOController
MOOController --> ProblemClass
MOOController --> NSGA2Algo
NSGA2Algo --> ProblemClass
ProblemClass --> MultiprocessPool
MultiprocessPool --> Evaluator
Evaluator --> SimWithCaps
SimWithCaps --> SimCore
SimWithCaps --> DelayBufferClass
SimWithCaps --> MachineClass
SimCore --> DelayBufferClass
SimCore --> MachineClass
InputVars --> ProblemClass
NSGA2Algo --> ResultNode
MOOController --> HistoryExporter
ResultNode --> HistoryExporter
HistoryExporter --> Manager

%% interaction details
ProblemClass -. evaluates population via .-> MultiprocessPool
Evaluator -. runs replications via .-> SimWithCaps
SimWithCaps -. builds model via .-> SimCore
MachineClass -. records metrics via .-> SimCore
DelayBufferClass -. enforces capacities and delays via .-> SimCore

